    "detailed_description": "Famine Way is a 2D adventure game in the author's style about Ukraine in 1932-1933 for personal computers and mobile devices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/8b568b3935a8e680ad48215551804252.poster.avif?t=1701887010\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/8b568b3935a8e680ad48215551804252.webm?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/8b568b3935a8e680ad48215551804252.mp4?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The basis of the gameplay is the survival of the protagonists and overcoming their path: escaping from their native village in search of loved ones. You will be able to go on a rich journey with a deep narrative and an authentic audiovisual approach. The game lacks traditional elements of communication, such as dialogues, descriptions and fights - therefore the exploration of the game world through the objects of the environment and music comes to the fore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/3107979123201e184f84bdda74a502a1.poster.avif?t=1701887010\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/3107979123201e184f84bdda74a502a1.webm?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/3107979123201e184f84bdda74a502a1.mp4?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this emotional adventure, we will meet the young heroine Olena, who was left alone during the Holodomor. The starting point of the story is the moment when she finds a wounded stork and embarks on a dangerous journey. Who Olena will become and what awaits her and her companion at the end is unknown. Immerse yourself in the narrative and explore a Ukrainian village and its surroundings during the Holodomor through the eyes of a little girl and a stork.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/1c8255b97d0fdd14e36e87aee8e356ac.poster.avif?t=1701887010\" width=776 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/1c8255b97d0fdd14e36e87aee8e356ac.webm?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/1c8255b97d0fdd14e36e87aee8e356ac.mp4?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Famine Way is a 2D adventure game in the author's style about Ukraine in 1932-1933 for personal computers and mobile devices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/8b568b3935a8e680ad48215551804252.poster.avif?t=1701887010\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/8b568b3935a8e680ad48215551804252.webm?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/8b568b3935a8e680ad48215551804252.mp4?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The basis of the gameplay is the survival of the protagonists and overcoming their path: escaping from their native village in search of loved ones. You will be able to go on a rich journey with a deep narrative and an authentic audiovisual approach. The game lacks traditional elements of communication, such as dialogues, descriptions and fights - therefore the exploration of the game world through the objects of the environment and music comes to the fore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/3107979123201e184f84bdda74a502a1.poster.avif?t=1701887010\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/3107979123201e184f84bdda74a502a1.webm?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/3107979123201e184f84bdda74a502a1.mp4?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this emotional adventure, we will meet the young heroine Olena, who was left alone during the Holodomor. The starting point of the story is the moment when she finds a wounded stork and embarks on a dangerous journey. Who Olena will become and what awaits her and her companion at the end is unknown. Immerse yourself in the narrative and explore a Ukrainian village and its surroundings during the Holodomor through the eyes of a little girl and a stork.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/1c8255b97d0fdd14e36e87aee8e356ac.poster.avif?t=1701887010\" width=776 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/1c8255b97d0fdd14e36e87aee8e356ac.webm?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672860/extras/1c8255b97d0fdd14e36e87aee8e356ac.mp4?t=1701887010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
